Heracles-taixu-sandbox is a fork of taixu, into which the three-tier execution
privilege model and the zero-width file channel from baicodex, and the wireless
ADB channel from tianxuan, have been ported as a one-off patch set. It is an
EXECUTION-SIDE sandbox only: no agent loop, no chat UI, no workflow editor and
no project template are included.


1. taixu — fork baseline (continuously tracked upstream)
--------------------------------------------------------
  Project      : taixu — Android No-Root Linux Runtime / Native Agent Harness /
                 PTY Terminal / Workspace & Tool Ecosystem
  Repository   : https://github.com/wkbin/taixu
  Baseline     : dc7fcddb88e565929379597bbd811b440d00e34f  (main, 2026-10-26)
  License      : GNU General Public License v3.0
  Copyright    : Copyright (C) 2026 王克斌

  Ported into this sandbox:
    runtime/.../proot/                 -> sandbox-runtime (ProotEngine et al.)
    runtime/.../pty/                   -> sandbox-runtime (PtySession)
    runtime/.../shell/                 -> sandbox-runtime (ProcessRegistry)
    runtime/.../rootfs/               -> sandbox-runtime (OciRootfsInstaller et al.)
    runtime/.../WorkspaceManager.kt    -> sandbox-runtime (WorkspaceManager)
    app/src/main/cpp/pty_native.c      -> sandbox-runtime/src/main/cpp/pty_bridge.cpp
