2. baicodex — one-off port source (NOT continuously tracked)
------------------------------------------------------------
  Project      : baicodex / BaiAgent — Android on-device AI Agent
  Repository   : https://github.com/mubai0122/baicodex
  Port commit  : fb4bd5f98bb8541ab0dcf83fb3b1ee29e6cb9d95  (main, 2026-10-27)
  License      : GNU General Public License v3.0

  Ported into this sandbox:
    b/ai/exec/Router.kt             -> sandbox-channel (ChannelSelector)
    b/ai/core/Perms.kt              -> sandbox-channel (ChannelManager state)
    b/ai/exec/Shiz.kt, ShizukuShell.kt -> sandbox-channel (ShizukuChannel)
    b/ai/exec/Root.kt               -> sandbox-channel (RootChannel)
    b/ai/exec/FileOps.kt            -> sandbox-file (ZeroWidthFileChannel)
    b/ai/exec/Workspace.kt          -> sandbox-file (PathSemantics, rewritten)

  NOT ported (deliberately):
    all Compose UI (ui/AskSheet.kt, ui/PermUi.kt, ui/DialogHost.kt,
    ui/ChatScreen.kt, ...), the agent loop (agent/Agent.kt, agent/Tools.kt),
    accessibility (exec/A11y.kt, exec/AutoA11y.kt), and the core/* grab bag.

  Note on the "zero-width file channel": the upstream implementation probes a
  list of path transformations against /storage/emulated/0/Android/{data,obb}
  and uses whichever transformation actually lists. It is a device-owner tool
  for that owner's own device; it does not reach /data/data/<pkg> and does not
  bypass SELinux. See docs/security-boundary.md.


3. tianxuan — one-off port source (NOT continuously tracked)
------------------------------------------------------------
  Project      : 天玄 TaiXuan — PRoot Linux sandbox + AI Agent Harness on
                 non-rooted Android
  Repository   : https://github.com/xiaozhe7772222/tianxuan
  Port commit  : caad40090a4f2c2edbe54e6eaae60a3dd1de7d21  (main, 2026-10-26)
  License      : GNU General Public License v3.0
  Copyright    : Copyright (C) 2026 王克斌

  Ported into this sandbox:
    service/adb/AdbNotificationManager.kt -> sandbox-channel (WirelessAdbChannel)
    service/adb/AdbNotificationReceiver.kt -> sandbox-channel
                                              (AdbPairingStateMachine)
    runtime/.../bridge/adb/EmbeddedAdbManager.kt -> sandbox-channel (adb transport)
    app/src/main/assets/bin/adb            -> reference only (adb wrapper script)

  NOT ported (HARD CONSTRAINT):
    The accessibility (AccessibilityService) channel. Accessibility privileges
    are too risky for open-source distribution and store review: they can read
    the entire screen and synthesise arbitrary input. If a host project needs
    GUI automation it must obtain accessibility permission itself; this sandbox
    only exposes a call surface for an already-authorised channel.


